Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\Nthen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We run on daunted, ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\Nthen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece. I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it. Be so bad, just be first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine. I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy, what are you doing? Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Megalo, come back here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.06,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, brothers, all my\Ncaretakers, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving without your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to be home by dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on an adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What has gotten into Megalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, he\Neven left the doors open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What if something were to happen to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and check on the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, stop writing my bones about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi never leaves her room!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you keeping her\Nlocked up here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.46,0:03:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep her safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemies are trying to get to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnap you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I failed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how far away the kidnappers are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kidnappers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're positive she was kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate connecting Fishman\NIsland to the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us where the switch\Nto open it is or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeleton, you have to get back to\NKing Nephew as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him the princess is gone\Nand that we're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't want any of this to\Nhappen, but it's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They told us that if we want to survive,\Nwe've got to follow their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just tell us okay who's orders\Nit doesn't matter just tell us or
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we're all gonna die I don't Just tell\Nus what in the world is going on here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You pirates are now under the control\Nof Horny Jones so listen closely
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got wonderful. You have the chance\Nto be part of a historic mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like Van Der Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he the captain\Nof the Flying Dutchman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That cursed ghost ship is a myth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm no ghost, but I am\NVan Der Decken's descendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.22,0:05:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a curse of my own as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm a fishman, I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this Devil Fruit power\Nknown as the Markmark fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I show you? You and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the stripes come here step right up me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,is nonsense and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you know it enough is enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those energy steroids you're taking\Nwill do nothing but mess up your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And no good can come of\Ndestroying Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of it, you're underestimating\Nthe power of Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, I've heard enough of your rambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to listen\Nto your voice anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you were an officer of\Nthe pirate group that I admired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're nothing but a washed-up coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, make way for the real pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to teach all of the humans a\Nlesson, we're gonna need Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That means Neptune is our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong thought Fishmen\Nwere the supreme race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no supreme race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deacon? Yasuie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you refused to help Arlong\Ninvade the East Blue when he was in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, what makes you want to\Nwork with these young punks now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant it for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are willing to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong was stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He never did pony up enough\Ndough to enlist my services.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he was always stuck taking\Ncrappy swordsmen like you along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,An angry Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember what happened back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong had the nerve to ask\Nme to work underneath him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a preposterous idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Van Der Decken never works under anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm my own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart gets that better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong had goals and an ability to\Nact on them, which I can respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was also brash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As a leader, he was lacking and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When you old-timers were\Nrunning rampant on the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we were all still too young to\Nbecome pirates, so we watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw what you did well\Nand what you did poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned from all your mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In that sense, we owe you our thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will continue right\Nwhere Arlong left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you're\Nnot on board with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've supported Arlong for\Nall those years, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disappointment you are, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirate who destroyed Arlong's dream,\NStraw Hat Luffy, is on Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect opportunity\Nfor some revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I fought him as a\Nmember of the Arlong Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he now calls me his friend. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of you are my friends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy also saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could, I would see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm too ashamed of my\Nfellow fishmen to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I face him when you're\Nclinging to Arlong's legacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You consider a human your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a real fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have forgotten\Nhow pirates do things
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,around here if there's\Nsomething you want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta use violence\Nto get your point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, what where\Nis he throwing it to did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You notice when I touched you earlier\NI marked you as my new target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I throw\Nor where I throw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it will always make its way\Nback to whatever I mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but it'll\Ncome back at you full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Decking just tossed the knife away from\Nthat guy and it came back to hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The mark. Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you figure them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You had better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me. Decking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough stories\Nabout your mark, mark power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make him stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop him. Horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As he told you earlier,\NVanderdecken isn't working under me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're allies on equal footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're really\Nstarting to get on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how fast you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or how far you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.12,0:10:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll keep chasing you until\Nthey meet their mark, and you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,what that means!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay if I can just\Nfind my way to the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There, I should be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully they sink in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They burst on the bubble like\Nit was nothing! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can leave up to two marks, one\Nfor each palm, left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've worn a glove on\Nthis one for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I touched Princess\NShirahoshi and made her my mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll stay that way forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can throw weapons and even my love,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll track you down to\Nthe furthest depths of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the mark. Mark curse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He can keep stalking the\Nprincess for as long as he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And stay right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of all, he'll never have to deal\Nwith fighting Neptune and his sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How devious can you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, about you human pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all familiar\Nwith Deccan's mark mark power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's begin the first\Nstage of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.56,0:12:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the Ryugu Palace is\Nimpregnable, but I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone in this room\Nhas been able to break
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,through its defenses\Nfor ten straight years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Him, Captain Vander Decken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be our cannon fodder,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning Decken will treat your\Nbodies as living ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing you straight into the\Nwall of the princess's tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course weapons can't smash it and\Nmost of you runts won't do any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you'll open up the\Ngate from inside the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,find the gate switch and let us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we can't make it that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd already be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.44,0:12:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From hitting the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want you humans to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lives don't mean anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In our world you're\Neither slaves or corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:13:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those of you who survived the\Nimpact carry out your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you succeed in opening\Nthe gate I'll set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you refuse to do it then leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of the bubble myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.36,0:13:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if if we leave the? bubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get to the top without drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,On the upside, that should
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,make this decision easy for you though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, our people
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,will forge a new history\Nwith our own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll start by conquering\Nthe Ryugu Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi, just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, back at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go so fast! We're injured!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the pace, skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imperative we make it to the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm begging you\Nto take us to that gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Party's gonna kill us all\Nif we don't get it open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight them. We gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them all up. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you realize we were\Ninnocent before you did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's their fault\Nfor trying to handcuff me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.10,0:14:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody's giving\Nus that dead fish stare,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and not because they're fishmen either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, they saw the guards attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were the one\Ndoing all the attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, you beat up a lot of them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your training really paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can buy me\Noff with a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The lady is in need!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, there's a man\Ncovered with blood on the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy from the Fishman District!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone call a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper and Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, we'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would someone do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Straw Hat here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start treating you in a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever your friends are, find\Nthem and get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get\Ninvolved, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on your boat and leave\Nthis place while you still can,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll be fighting for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hordeon, Deccan, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The new fishman pirates will start\Nattacking the whole island soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But once they do, the\NRyugu kingdom will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess has been kidnapped.\NI don't know how, but they must.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,have broken into the room also\Npirates are crashing into the tower
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it's bizarre in any case they'll\Nbe here any minute get ready
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kidnapped somebody's taken away my\NShirahoshi who was it i'll kill them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,wait there's a pirate\Nraid going on and they
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mean this is the worst\Ntime. All I want is get.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,out of here and now\Nit's some kind of pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,party we're screwed fine\Njust ignore me jerk i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,cut him violence is the\Nlast thing we need right
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,now if we want to make\Nit out of here alive we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,have to open up the gates\Nno matter what oh no
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,they're here you can come\Nout of the shark now you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd rather stay inside for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice after being\Ncooped up for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my heart is racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably worried sick about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been out five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a little fun, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real adventure, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If your heart's racing,\Nit counts as an adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned a thing\Ncalled a sea forest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a pretty cool place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, there's one grave that I never\Ngot to visit because I was locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years I've wanted to go, and now\Nmy only dream can finally come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been ten long\Nyears since her assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,in broad daylight proved\NFishman Island into upheaval.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The princes have grown into\Nstrong and worthy protectors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi is locked\Nin the tower, but she is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for you, your memory survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ideals will live on forever.
